        {
          "text": "26",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi doko kwero neko Saulo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.54.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 54:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji moro ma jowok Zif jobino, aka jowaco ri Saulo ni Daudi opondo i got Hakila, i gike ma thim Yesimon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo oay gi cwo 3,000 m'oyero wok kwoŋ Joisiraili to joloro i thim ma Zif rango Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jokidho to jocokere dho yo wi got Hakila. Daudi oyido fodi nitie i thim, aka munyo owinjo ni Saulo obino rango go i thim, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ooro jopendo niaŋ ka Saulo obino adieri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi oay to kidho kama Saulo gi cwo pere oyido jocokere iye; to Daudi neno kama Saulo gi wod pa Ner Abuner jamituka jolweny pere oyido jonindo iye. Saulo oyido nindo i kambi aka cwo pere jothoko go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Daudi penjo Ahimelek Jahiti, gi Abisay omin Yowab (me wot dhako m'ilwoŋo ni Zeruya) ni, “Ŋa ma lakidho kodan i kambi pa Saulo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abisay odwoko ni, “Alaloro kodin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Daudi gi Abisay jodonjo i kambi pa Saulo wor, aka Saulo oyido nindo i dier kambi, aka toŋ pere ocom piny cegin gi wiye. Abuner gi jolweny oyido jonindo thoko Saulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abisay owaco ri Daudi ni, “Rwoth omiyin jakwor perin i cingin wor me. Riameno weyi acwow go dicel kende gi toŋ pere won; ak'ocwow go dirio.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi odwoko Abisay ni, “Ikir'ineki go; rupiri Rwoth bino miyo gir'acula ri ŋatimoro je m'oketh cinge kwoŋ kere ma go won owiro gi mo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi omedere waco ni, “Paka Rwoth kwo, Rwoth won bino neko go, ka k'obedo ameno go bino tho ka okidho i lweny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Rwoth ogeŋan ketho cingan kwoŋ ŋati ma go won owiro gi mo bedo kere. Weyi wakwanyi toŋ pere g'agwata pere ma pi wakadhi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Daudi okwanyo toŋ gi agwata pi m'oyido nitie yuwiy Saulo, to jokadho. Ongoye ŋati m'oneno jo kosa oŋeyo gim'otimere kosa ocew, joje oyido jonindo, rupiri Rwoth odhiro rijo nindo mapek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi oŋado to kidho loka man ma milelo wi got bor gi Saulo gin ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka okoko to lwoŋo cwo pa Saulo gi Abuner ka waco ama: “Abuner, iwinjan?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abuner openjo ni, “Meno ŋa ma lwoŋo kere?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi odwoko ni, “Ŋa ma cale in Abuner kwoŋ Joisiraili je! To raŋo ikigwoko kwo pa jadwoŋ perin kere? Pama won me nyatoro moro owok bino neko jadwoŋ perin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gim'itimo me kiber Abuner! Akwoŋere i nyingi Rwoth makwo ni win joje ber ni witho rupiri wikigwoko jadwoŋ mewin kere ma Rwoth owiro gi mo. Neni! Nikune toŋ pa kere g'agwata pi pere m'oyido nitie yuwiye?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo ocew to niaŋ ni manago obedo dwondi Daudi to penjo ni, “Meno dwondin Daudi? Meno in wodan?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi odwoko ni, “Meno dwondan, jadwoŋ paran, kere.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi omedere waco ni, “Raŋo fodi idwaro ŋeca perin jadwoŋ? Aŋo m'atimo? Aŋo marac m'atimo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jadwoŋ winji wac paran. K'inen Rwoth am'omiyin mon kodan, miyo go cowirok lamiyo go wiro paro pere; to k'inen obedo ji, lam pa Rwoth opodhi kwoŋ jo. Rupiri jomiyan wok piny Isiraili t'abino i piny m'alamo iye werin pa jopath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno ikir'imiy remo paran ooy i piny pa jopath, bor gi Rwoth. Raŋo kere ma Isiraili obino neko an lwaŋino me? Raŋo go dwaran paŋini winyo madudi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo odwoko ni, “Atimo gimarac. Dwoki Daudi wodan! Doko akibino temo timo rin gimarac rupiri wor me inwaŋo silwany ma nekan to ikitimo ameno. Neni, atimo gimiŋo aka atimo gimarac swa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
